<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>每日奇遇 - 沙雕园</title><link>https://blog.shadiao.win/tags/%E6%AF%8F%E6%97%A5%E5%A5%87%E9%81%87/</link><description>欢迎来到沙雕园。本博客要素较多，包括但不限于数学、编程、游戏、吐槽、冲塔、科普、整活。</description><language>zh-cn</language><atom:link href="https://blog.shadiao.win/tags/%E6%AF%8F%E6%97%A5%E5%A5%87%E9%81%87/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>#每日老年痴呆 #每日奇遇 坐飞机，正美滋滋地坐着候机，一个穿制…</title><link>https://blog.shadiao.win/moments/closed-social-114900728958867831/</link><guid>https://blog.shadiao.win/moments/closed-social-114900728958867831/</guid><description>&lt;p>&lt;a href="https://thu.closed.social/tags/%E6%AF%8F%E6%97%A5%E8%80%81%E5%B9%B4%E7%97%B4%E5%91%86" rel="noopener noreferrer">#&lt;span>每日老年痴呆&lt;/span>&lt;/a> &lt;a href="https://thu.closed.social/tags/%E6%AF%8F%E6%97%A5%E5%A5%87%E9%81%87" rel="noopener noreferrer">#&lt;span>每日奇遇&lt;/span>&lt;/a> 坐飞机，正美滋滋地坐着候机，一个穿制服的人走过来叫我，我还以为我发表什么正义言论被查水表了，结果人家递给我一个行李箱，然后扬长而去。我这才发现我忘了拿行李箱，甚至想不起来在哪落下的，应该是安检完了就忘了拿，并且我一直没发现。也不知道他怎么找到我的，看了监控一路找过来吗 &lt;img src="https://blog.shadiao.win/closed-social-emoji/630adb3280013865f421.png" alt=":tv50:" title=":tv50:" class="closed-social-emoji" width="24" height="24" style="display:inline-block;width:1.3em;height:1.3em;margin:0;vertical-align:-.2em;border-radius:0">&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>#每日奇遇 #每日小笨文 注册xjp航空账号的时候，出于整活目的…</title><link>https://blog.shadiao.win/moments/closed-social-114011408318047269/</link><guid>https://blog.shadiao.win/moments/closed-social-114011408318047269/</guid><description>&lt;p>&lt;a href="https://thu.closed.social/tags/%E6%AF%8F%E6%97%A5%E5%A5%87%E9%81%87" rel="noopener noreferrer">#&lt;span>每日奇遇&lt;/span>&lt;/a> &lt;a href="https://thu.closed.social/tags/%E6%AF%8F%E6%97%A5%E5%B0%8F%E7%AC%A8%E6%96%87" rel="noopener noreferrer">#&lt;span>每日小笨文&lt;/span>&lt;/a> &lt;br>注册xjp航空账号的时候，出于整活目的我选了princess作为title。一开始没遇到任何问题。但今日试图订票发现要写性别，而性别必须和title匹配 &lt;img src="https://blog.shadiao.win/closed-social-emoji/4d5143941690f7df78d3.png" alt=":psyduck:" title=":psyduck:" class="closed-social-emoji" width="24" height="24" style="display:inline-block;width:1.3em;height:1.3em;margin:0;vertical-align:-.2em;border-radius:0"> 官网上甚至不能改title&lt;br>非常的斯丢屁德，已经找客服吐槽了&lt;/p>&lt;p>现在我打算写个女直接订票，我生理性别男心里性别女，他敢不让我登基就举办他歧视LGBT！用魔法打败魔法！&lt;/p>&lt;p>&lt;a href="https://thu.closed.social/tags/%E6%AF%8F%E6%97%A5lgbt" rel="noopener noreferrer">#&lt;span>每日lgbt&lt;/span>&lt;/a> （？）&lt;/p>
&lt;p>&lt;a href="https://blog.shadiao.win/moments/closed-social-114011408318047269/image-8fa0b04bf9a9fff9.jpeg">&lt;img src="https://blog.shadiao.win/moments/closed-social-114011408318047269/image-8fa0b04bf9a9fff9.jpeg" alt="配图 1" loading="lazy">&lt;/a>&lt;/p></description></item></channel></rss>